# Snapshot of Proxmox's trixie pve-no-subscription Packages index for exactly the
# components pinned in config/upstream-overrides.txt (the smx03 set), one Package:
# stanza per BINARY package name at the version each pin's "# <version>" comment
# records, with "-1" as the Debian revision (the pins carry none). Source-only
# component names are resolved to the binary package names the index carries, per
# config/upstream-source-binaries.txt. Newest stanza per component comes last, and
# the older pve-container stanza is the version tests/test-drift-sync.sh's probe
# down-bumps a pin to. This is the offline stand-in for the live drift fetch: the
# drift check's --packages option takes this file instead of the fetched index.

